 labels and do not echo the local path.
 
+## Full Lab Rebuild Summary
+
+`make provider-lab-full-rebuild` generates a local operator summary for the
+full lab rebuild run without contacting or modifying real devices from an
+automated Codex task. The target writes the baseline, Cisco bootstrap, iLO,
+RAID, ESXi boot, final markdown reports, and a redacted JSON summary under
+`artifacts/codex-runs/`.
+
+The Provider Status page reads `GET /api/v1/lab/full-rebuild-summary` and shows
+the latest stage state, blockers, and report paths. Real device write stages
+remain blocked in this summary when the run is executed from automated Codex
+context; historical artifacts are referenced only as evidence and are not
+treated as fresh live validation.
+
 ### Edits
 
 VM deployment requests can be updated through `PATCH /api/v1/requests/{id}`.
